⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
299 calories 38g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)

Chocolatey Love A-fair Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Book with over 150 recipes like this one!

- 1 Chocolate Protein Shake (350-400ml)
- 20-25g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 10g cocoa powder
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- ½ of a @hormbles (I used the old version so it was 50 calories and 5g of protein for this amount)
- 12g (2 pieces) Rolos, chopped (or any chocolate covered caramels)
- 7g caramel syrup
299 cal 27g C, 9g F, 38g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the chopped chocolate and Rolos
7. Run the “Mix-in” cycle
8. Top with the caramel syrup

